    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284-a1">

                <pb facs="0563" n="493" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg493"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Poplar River, Montana</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1883-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 11, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Breck</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Assistant Adjutant-General, Fort Snelling:</hi></p>
                <p>Agent Porter has called upon me to remove intruders from reservation,
                    apprehending serious trouble between them and Indians. Sent detachment last;
                    night, and will overtake them myself to-day; go in command of party, and capture
                    or remove all trespassers I can find.</p>
                <closer><signed>READ,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Headquarters Department of Dakota</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Fort Snelling, Minn.</hi></placeName>, <date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1883-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >January</hi> 15, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                    <p>Official copy respectfully forwarded to headquarters Military Division of the
                        Missouri.</p>
                    <closer><signed>ALFRED H. TERRY,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Brigadier-General,
                                Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
